WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.201
Each track supports federal rules
the agency already has to meet,

2
00:00:04.201 --> 00:00:05.738
in the program's mapping.

3
00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:11.614
The HR track carries account management,
personnel termination and transfer,

4
00:00:11.614 --> 00:00:18.575
and identifier management in NIST 800-53,
plus M-19-17 and the Federal HR 2.0 memo.

5
00:00:18.575 --> 00:00:23.725
PIV sign-in serves M-22-09 and FIPS 201.

6
00:00:23.725 --> 00:00:28.239
Intune and Arc carry the
configuration and inventory controls,

7
00:00:28.239 --> 00:00:33.264
the non-person track carries privileged
accounts and authenticators,

8
00:00:33.264 --> 00:00:36.500
and every track feeds
monitoring under M-26-14.

9
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:41.088
Your authorizing official decides; the
architecture supplies the evidence.

10
00:00:41.088 --> 00:00:43.440
Next, a primer on attributes.
